      "text": "\n\nThe trip combines time in nature with outdoor activities. You’ll cruise the Río Frío, take part in chocolate and coffee experiences, walk through tropical forest, and try zip-lining, canyoning and rafting. After a busy first week, you’ll have three free days by the Apoyo Lagoon.\n\n## Photos from the route\n\nThe photos show:\n\n- Arenal Volcano and the national park\n- Granada, Nicaragua\n- San José\n- Costa Rica’s hanging bridges\n- a coffee plantation\n- the chocolate experience\n- the Monteverde Cloud Forest\n- Costa Rica’s tropical forest\n- Managua\n- a zip-line tour.\n"
